    "media_with_text_rBWPLP": {
      "type": "media-with-text",
      "blocks": {
        "heading_nfknF9": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "It's built to last",
            "heading_size": "h3",
            "heading_h1": false
          }
        },
        "text_PrPm7q": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Made from high-quality cast iron, it can withstand the elements and is ready for any adventure. Its durable construction and versatile uses make it an indispensable companion for all outdoor enthusiasts. </p><p>Of course, it also looks good on a gas grill or any stove. A real all-rounder!</p>",
            "enlarge_text": true
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "heading_nfknF9",
        "text_PrPm7q"
      ],
      "settings": {
        "image": "shopify://shop_images/Feuertopf_dutch_Oven_ft9_3_5a34664f-e313-4361-87f0-1e784561d080.webp",
        "video_external": "",
        "video_description": "",
        "video_autoplay": false,
        "layout": "left",
        "image_fit": "contain",
        "media_width": 50,
        "media_scale": 100,
        "text_align": "text-start",
        "color_scheme": "none",
        "only_content_color_scheme": false
      }
    },
    "media_with_text_7ftHhm": {
      "type": "media-with-text",
      "blocks": {
        "heading_dQEfXw": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Use the lid as a frypan",
            "heading_size": "h3",
            "heading_h1": false
          }
        },
        "text_GfxD3A": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>That's one of the great features of the Petromax Dutch oven. Its versatility allows you to use it not just as a pot for slow cooking or baking but also as a skillet for frying or sautéing when you flip the lid over. </p><p>The lid's legs make it stable on the fire or stove.</p>",
            "enlarge_text": true
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "heading_dQEfXw",
        "text_GfxD3A"
      ],
      "settings": {
        "image": "shopify://shop_images/DSC01602DSC01602.webp",
        "video_external": "",
        "video_description": "",
        "video_autoplay": false,
        "layout": "right",
        "image_fit": "contain",
        "media_width": 50,
        "media_scale": 100,
        "text_align": "text-start",
        "color_scheme": "none",
        "only_content_color_scheme": false
      }
    },
    "media_with_text_d7DWXR": {
      "type": "media-with-text",
      "blocks": {
        "heading_e4AFhN": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "The lid has a raised edge",
            "heading_size": "h3",
            "heading_h1": false
          }
        },
        "text_GtWrKG": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>The raised edge of the lid makes it easy to place coals on the dutch oven as well. This method ensures that the pot is heated evenly from all sides, making it suitable for tasks such as baking bread. The raised edge helps keeps the coals and ash contained to avoid messing on your food every time you open the lid for a sneak peek.</p>",
            "enlarge_text": true
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "heading_e4AFhN",
        "text_GtWrKG"
      ],
      "settings": {
        "image": "shopify://shop_images/Cabix_Plus_Briketts_c_plus_1.webp",
        "video_external": "",
        "video_description": "",
        "video_autoplay": false,
        "layout": "left",
        "image_fit": "contain",
        "media_width": 50,
